  "id": "chicken-fajita-rice-casserole",
  "name": "Chicken Fajita Rice Casserole",
  "subtitle": "A baked rice casserole with seasoned chicken, peppers, onion, cilantro, and lime.",
  "description": "Layer seasoned chicken and vegetables over lime-cilantro rice, then bake everything together until tender and safely cooked.",
